      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "A business plan is like a map for starting and running a business: it plans what you want to do, how you will do it and how you will succeed."
          },
          {
            "type": "checkpoint",
            "mode": "self_check",
            "prompt": "Why compare a business plan to a map?",
            "explanation": "Like a map, it shows where you are going and the route to get there, so you are less likely to get lost along the way."
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "level": 2,
            "text": "Quick recap"
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "Business plan: a map of what, how and how to succeed."
            ]
          }
        ]
